The voidwalker is a **tank**, not a damage dealer — its value is survivability (Sacrifice, Consume Shadows, taunt) and utility (Seduction, Lesser Invisibility), which makes it far more reliable in dungeons, raids, and PvP. The succubus, while stronger for solo leveling and questing due to its damage and stealth, is fragile and lacks the tanking utility that groups need. [end of text]


